# WINDOWS-SENSITIVE PATHS (Bazel workplan P0-14, decision D17's fast loop). A change to any of these goes
# through a PR with CI green on Linux, macOS and Windows, never a direct push to main (AGENTS.md, "Pushing
# to main"), and GitHub asks the owner and the Windows contributor to review it (never a PR's own author).
# Requested, not required. main's ruleset (applied with P0-14) makes everyone but the repository owner use
# a PR with an approval and `gates green`; the owner, and the agent sessions running as the owner, bypass
# it and keep this rule by convention. Add a path here when a change to it has broken, or could break, a
# Windows desk.
